'''Santa Caterina Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Santa Caterina}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: STC, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: STIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Santa Caterina]], a community in the [[La Terra Alta]] comarca of [[Migjorn Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located in the Shendan-facing interior of the isthmus and serves the surrounding highland communities. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

